            "review_title": "Review at Norden Steakhouse",
            "review_text": "Tan L\n13 contributions\n0\nBest steak restaurant in Nha Trang\nOct 2026 • Family\nGreat Nordic atmosphere with steaks prepared in the open kitchen for us to see. Juicy meat and fresh salads. The kids loves the spaghetti with striploin cut. The bone marrow with sourdough bread as the appetizer and chocolate fondant for dessert was to die for.\nInsider tip:\nThe Tomahawk with chimichurry, peppersauce and truffle mash potato was a safe choice.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten October 7, 2026",
